Q\"1F'/%+foregroundGQ([0,0,0]F'/%)readonlyGQ&falseF'/%,mathvariantGQ'n
ormalF'/%)rowalignGQ!F'/%,columnalignGFF/%+groupalignGFF/%(rowspanGF:/
%+columnspanGF:F4F4FDFGFI-F26(-F56(-F86&Q\"2F'F;F>FAFDFGFIFKFMFQFQFDFG
FI-F26(-F56(-F86&Q\"3F'F;F>FAFDFGFIFKFMFXFXFDFGFI/%&alignGQ%axisF'/FEQ
)baselineF'/FHQ&rightF'/FJQ'|frleft|hrF'/%/alignmentscopeGQ%trueF'/%,c
olumnwidthGQ%autoF'/%&widthGFeo/%+rowspacingGQ&1.0exF'/%.columnspacing
GQ&0.8emF'/%)rowlinesGQ%noneF'/%,columnlinesGF`p/%&frameGF`p/%-framesp
acingGQ,0.4em~0.5exF'/%*equalrowsGF@/%-equalcolumnsGF@/%-displaystyleG
